flowchart LR
    A[Input Message<br/>text + metadata like time_of_day] --> B[Convert to Features<br/>word counts, n-grams, categorical tokens]
    B --> C["Estimate Class Probabilities<br/>P(class)"]
    B --> D[Estimate Feature Likelihoods<br/>P(feature | class)]
    C --> E[Apply Bayes Rule]
    D --> E
    E --> F[Posterior Score Per Class<br/>P(class | features)]
    F --> G[Choose Highest Probability Class]
    G --> H[Predicted Sender]

    I[Naive Assumption<br/>features treated as conditionally independent given class] --> E
    J[Laplace Smoothing<br/>handles unseen or rare words] --> D